{"articleNo":"243601","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=243601&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] [근로] (마감)2020-2학기 학기 중 대학근로장학생 추가 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.10.13","hit":"8097","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><font size=\"5\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">- 2020-2학기 학기 중&nbsp;대학근로장학생 모집 안내 -</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></strong></strong></span></p><div class=\"view_content\" id=\"view_content\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"3\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong>1.&nbsp;자격요건</strong></span><br></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;가.&nbsp;2020-2학기&nbsp;재학생&nbsp;중&nbsp;직전학기&nbsp;성적&nbsp;70점/100점&nbsp;만점(평점&nbsp;1.6)&nbsp;이상</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;나.&nbsp;정규학기&nbsp;내&nbsp;재학생&nbsp;(휴학생,&nbsp;초과학기자&nbsp;제외)</span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2.&nbsp;신청기간</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2020.10.13~</span></strong></strong></span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">3.&nbsp;근로기간</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2020.10월 중~2020.12.20.(일)&nbs